{"data": [{"author_id": "2893886738", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:17:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114888622675730698", "2114889151892144430"], "id": "2114889151892144430", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 5686, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "2025年末，中国总人口140489万，比上年减少339万。全年出生792万，为1949年以来最低；死亡1131万，人口连续第四年负增长。\n\n值得关注的，不是总人口何时跌破14亿，而是人口结构正在发生深刻变化。\n\n出生人口比2024年少了约162万，降幅约17%，生育下滑速度超出许多人预期。", "url": "https://x.com/kangke888/status/2114889151892144430"}, {"author_id": "2893886738", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:15:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114888622675730698", "2114889151892144430"], "id": "2114888622675730698", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 422, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年末，中国总人口140489万，比上年减少339万。全年出生792万，为1949年以来最低；死亡1131万，人口连续第四年负增长。\n\n值得关注的，不是总人口何时跌破14亿，而是人口结构正在发生深刻变化。\n\n出生人口比2024年少了约162万，降幅约17%，生育下滑速度超出许多人预期。", "url": "https://x.com/kangke888/status/2114888622675730698"}, {"author_id": "1905673226182619136", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:40:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114864740153352644"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Zm6N9iEs2C", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SGautreau29553/status/2114864740153352644/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114864631265034240", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/Zm6N9iEs2C"}, {"display_url": "x.com/elonmusk/statu…", "end": 321, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2114764208399421635", "start": 298, "url": "https://t.co/7YYegiivJN"}]}, "id": "2114864740153352644", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 192, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114764208399421635", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Not a doomer- I love technology. ❤️\nBut I am a pragmatist.\nSocial media and AI are accelerating the fertility co